# Taster of Wares {2}{B}: "When this creature enters, target opponent reveals X cards from their hand, where X is the number of
# Goblins you control. You choose one of those cards. That player exiles it. If an instant or sorcery card is exiled this way, you
# may cast it for as long as you control this creature, and mana of any type can be spent to cast that spell" (CR 701.20a, 608.2d,
# 609.4b). Taster is Bot1's only Goblin, so Bot2 reveals one card of its choosing - the Lightning Bolt, not the Counterspell or an
# Island - and it is exiled. Mox Pearl's {W} pays for the Bolt cast from exile, which hits Bot2 and goes to its owner's graveyard.

